  {
   "key": "func RRCollector.adoptArchivedCopy(_:)",
   "hash": "bea39d8e71378a0b",
   "does": "When currentSession is the same session as the archived copy and the card holds the archive's copy (the id is reviewArchivedSessionId or the paused session), replaces it with the archived copy. With reviewArchivedEntries recorded for this id, each of tags, notes and morning feeling that differs on the card from those entries is kept from the card, the others come from the archived copy, and the entries are then reset to the archived copy's; without them the archived copy is taken whole. The paused session's held copy takes the adopted copy too while it is still paused. Otherwise does nothing.",
   "entry": null,
